rust-proxmox-systemd (1.0.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * notify: send the monotonic time along with RELOADING=1, as systemd's
    Type=notify-reload requires. With that type, 'systemctl reload' returns only
    once the service reported that it is ready again.

  * notify: send status messages with their STATUS= prefix, without which
    systemd ignored them.

